s and calculations for the biofiltration pond. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-36/guide.md`\n- **Sheet 37 [Landscape Details]:** Contains landscape details for tree planting, tree protection, and shrubs. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-37/guide.md`\n- **Sheet 38 [Wall Plan]:** Plan view, section details, and notes for retaining walls. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-38/guide.md`\n- **Sheet 39 [Wall Plan Details And Notes]:** Details and cross-sections for multiple pond retaining walls. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-39/guide.md`\n\n## Supplementary Documents\n\n1. **Project Review Form** (documentId: `e1c5768d-263b-4500-98ff-f6723ae5876c`) — A completed City of Austin form indicating applicable land development codes and site plan application details for the project. → `supplementary-docs/project-review-form/overview.md`\n2. **Completeness Check Results** (documentId: `ba9815a3-047c-473a-a152-86ba84aae6d1`) — City of Austin site plan completeness check results detailing reviewer statuses and applicant responses to deficiencies. → `supplementary-docs/completeness-check-results/overview.md`\n3. **Consolidated Site Plan Application** (documentId: `2fa9891b-9ede-4030-9300-cce670e070e1`) — Completeness check submittal for a consolidated site plan permit application in the City of Austin. → `supplementary-docs/consolidated-site-plan-application/overview.md`\n4. **Master Comment Report** (documentId: `ca29fbe6-6361-4580-848e-7807ae462499`) — A comprehensive compilation of city staff review comments requiring updates for a site plan application. → `supplementary-docs/master-comment-report/overview.md`\n5. **Erosion Control Fiscal Estimate** (documentId: `e77f8b2c-e37c-41b5-8c16-0319b3c00cda`) — An engineer's cost estimate for erosion and sedimentation controls required for the project site. → `supplementary-docs/erosion-control-fiscal-estimate/overview.md`\n6. **TIA Determination Worksheet** (documentId: `0dbc90ac-37a5-4a6d-a51f-42b839ecb91b`) — Completed worksheet determining that a traffic impact analysis is not required for the proposed site plan development. → `supplementary-docs/tia-determination-worksheet/overview.md`\n7. **Travis County Tax Certificate** (documentId: `cc3df4f3-7134-4ca3-9571-48c0260bfeed`) — Official Travis County document certifying that property taxes for the specified lot are fully paid. → `supplementary-docs/travis-county-tax-certificate/overview.md`\n8. **Property Tax Documentation** (documentId: `135639d9-9070-45b5-8b3b-8df3dbb0c795`) — Provides evidence that formal tax certificates have been ordered and confirms zero property taxes are currently due. → `supplementary-docs/property-tax-documentation/overview.md`\n9. **Engineer's Summary Letter** (documentId: `726dac64-638d-4735-8a24-c3e2d243a2b8`) — An engineer's summary letter detailing existing conditions, proposed improvements, and utilities for the project site plan. → `supplementary-docs/engineer-s-summary-letter/overview.md`\n10. **Project Location Map** (documentId: `10f3f1b9-e25e-4118-bfe3-08ea287ce738`) — A map displaying the geographical location of the project site relative to surrounding streets and parcels. → `supplementary-docs/project-location-map/overview.md`\n\n## Other Files\n\n- `facts.md` — Surveyed property facts (address, zoning, flood zone, etc.)\n","numLines":69,"startLine":1,"totalLines":69}}}
