es into the property**. It runs roughly parallel to the top boundary line ($S63^\\circ02'28''E$) but is set inward. It crosses over an area marked \"ASPHALT,\" connects to a pole within a \"5' ELEC EASEMENT,\" continues rightwards across the property, and exits near the top-right corner.\n*   **Crossing the Property (Bottom/Right Area):** Another \"- O.H.U.L. -\" originates from the utility pole located midway along the bottom boundary ($N63^\\circ30'57''W$). It **crosses diagonally across the site** (moving upwards and to the right in page orientation), passing over \"ASPHALT\" and near a \"15' ELEC EASEMENT\" before exiting the property across the right boundary line ($S27^\\circ19'28''W$).\n\n### 4 & 5. Electric Easements, Utility Markings, and Specific Locations\nSeveral specific electric easements and utility-related markings are explicitly labeled on the survey:\n\n*   **\"5' ELEC EASEMENT VOL. 4443, PG. 74 P.R.T.C.TX\"**: A dashed rectangular area located midway along the Top boundary ($S63^\\circ02'28''E$), corresponding with the path of the northern O.H.U.L. and a utility pole.\n*   **\"5' ELEC EASEMENT VOL. 8168, PG. 611 P.R.T.C.TX\"**: A dashed rectangular area located midway along the Bottom boundary ($N63^\\circ30'57''W$), directly adjacent to a utility pole and the start of the southern O.H.U.L. crossing.\n*   **\"15' ELEC EASEMENT VOL. 4349, PG. 182 P.R.T.C.TX\"**: A dashed line denoting an easement located in the bottom-right quadrant of the page, near where the southern O.H.U.L. exits the property across boundary $S27^\\circ19'28''W$.\n*   **\"ELEC METER\"**: Labeled with an arrow pointing to a small square symbol on the bottom edge (page orientation) of the main central building structure (\"SLAB F.F.E.=686.8'\").\n*   **\"TRANSFORMER ON PAD\"**: A rectangular symbol containing a \"T\" located to the right (page orientation) of the main central building slab, roughly midway along the right side of the building footprint.\n*   **\"5' P.U.E.\"**: Public Utility Easements are marked running parallel just inside multiple property lines, specifically noted along portions of the Top ($S63^\\circ02'28''E$) and Bottom ($N63^\\circ30'57''W$) boundaries, referencing \"PLAT RECORDS VOL. 73, PG. 78 P.R.T.C.TX\".","providerOptions":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}]}]},"providerMetadata":{"google":{"promptFeedback":null,"groundingMetadata":null,"urlContextMetadata":null,"safetyRatings":null,"serviceTier":null},"gateway":{"routing":{"originalModelId":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","resolvedProvider":"vertex","resolvedProviderApiModelId":"gemini-3.1-pro-preview","fallbacksAvailable":["google"],"planningReasoning":"System credentials planned for: vertex, google. Total execution order: vertex(system) → google(system)","canonicalSlug":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","finalProvider":"vertex","modelAttemptCount":1,"modelAttempts":[{"modelId":"vertex:gemini-3.1-pro-preview","canonicalSlug":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","success":true,"providerAttemptCount":1,"providerAttempts":[{"provider":"vertex","internalModelId":"vertex:gemini-3.1-pro-preview","providerApiModelId":"gemini-3.1-pro-preview","credentialType":"system","success":true,"startTime":498244.757864,"endTime":550447.52437,"statusCode":200,"providerResponseId":"1VXraZu0BbLhsbwPwcTx2QI"}]}],"totalProviderAttemptCount":1},"cost":"0.07162","marketCost":"0.07162","inferenceCost":"0.07162","inputInferenceCost":"0.002836","outputInferenceCost":"0.068784","generationId":"gen_01KPZMEHXZE2GWT6T0VKBWDP9G"}}}]},"msg":"Vision response"}
