e distances (e.g., building setback from OHE lines, or clear workspace zones around the transformer).\n\n**5) Where is the proposed electrical infrastructure (underground lines, transformers, meters)?**\n*   **Transformers:** There is one proposed transformer location shown. It is located on the Western side of the site, situated between the northernmost entrance driveway and Building 1. It is indicated by a square box and labeled exactly as **\"Transformer Pad (Typ.)\"**.\n*   **Meters:** There are no distinct electrical meter banks or individual electric meters explicitly drawn or labeled on the building footprints on this sheet.\n*   **Underground Lines:** The specific routing of proposed underground electrical lines (such as the primary feed from the OHE to the transformer, or the secondary feeds from the transformer to the buildings) is not depicted with explicit line types on this drawing.","providerMetadata":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}],"finishReason":"stop","usage":{"inputTokens":1387,"outputTokens":800,"totalTokens":4667,"reasoningTokens":2480},"warnings":[],"providerMetadata":{"google":{"promptFeedback":null,"groundingMetadata":null,"urlContextMetadata":null,"safetyRatings":null,"serviceTier":null},"gateway":{"routing":{"originalModelId":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","resolvedProvider":"vertex","resolvedProviderApiModelId":"gemini-3.1-pro-preview","fallbacksAvailable":["google"],"planningReasoning":"System credentials planned for: vertex, google. Total execution order: vertex(system) → google(system)","canonicalSlug":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","finalProvider":"vertex","modelAttemptCount":1,"modelAttempts":[{"modelId":"vertex:gemini-3.1-pro-preview","canonicalSlug":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","success":true,"providerAttemptCount":1,"providerAttempts":[{"provider":"vertex","internalModelId":"vertex:gemini-3.1-pro-preview","providerApiModelId":"gemini-3.1-pro-preview","credentialType":"system","success":true,"startTime":508358.499401,"endTi