tern side (serving Bldgs 1, 2, 8), traverses eastward across the north (serving Bldgs 1, 3, 4), loops through the central and eastern portions (serving Bldgs 4, 5), and traverses the southern portion (serving Bldgs 6, 7). This blue routing line directly connects to every \"Electrical Transformer Pad\", \"Electrical Pull Box\", and the **\"Electrical Meters\"** banks shown on the sides of every building (Bldg 1-8).\n\n**6. Are there dimensions or clearance notes shown for any electrical equipment?**\nNo. While there are standard property line and building footprint dimensions shown on the plan, there are no explicit dimension lines, callouts, or text notes detailing specific clearance requirements or setback distances for the electrical equipment relative to the buildings or proposed structures on this specific sheet.","providerOptions":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}]}]},"providerMetadata":{"google":{"promptFeedback":null,"groundingMetadata":null,"urlContextMetadata":null,"safetyRatings":null,"serviceTier":null},"gateway":{"routing":{"originalModelId":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","resolvedProvider":"vertex","resolvedProviderApiModelId":"gemini-3.1-pro-preview","fallbacksAvailable":["google"],"planningReasoning":"System credentials planned for: vertex, google. Total execution order: vertex(system) → google(system)","canonicalSlug":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","finalProvider":"vertex","modelAttemptCount":1,"modelAttempts":[{"modelId":"vertex:gemini-3.1-pro-preview","canonicalSlug":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","success":true,"providerAttemptCount":1,"providerAttempts":[{"provider":"vertex","internalModelId":"vertex:gemini-3.1-pro-preview","providerApiModelId":"gemini-3.1-pro-preview","credentialType":"system","success":true,"startTime":547112.438749,"endTime":600291.996337,"statusCode":200,"providerResponseId":"BVbraYjEA5ynsbwPw_bbmQ8"}]}],"totalProviderAttemptCount":1},"cost":"0.040702","marketCost":"0.040702","inferenceCost":"0.040702","inputInferenceCos