 types designated with ` - OHE - ` run outside the property line along the western (left) and southern (bottom) boundaries of the plan.\n\n**3) Notation About the Type of Electrical Service:**\nThere is no text or notation explicitly stating the type of electrical service (e.g., \"distribution\" or \"transmission\") on this sheet.\n\n**4) Scale of the Drawing:**\nIn the top right corner, there is a graphic scale with the exact text: `\"Scale 1\" = 20'\"`. \n\n**5) Reference to Conductors or Overhead Lines:**\n*   **Overhead Lines:** The drawing references overhead lines primarily through the line type labels ` - OHE - ` located along the western and southern boundaries. There is also a small label pointing to a line on the far west edge that reads `\"Existing Overhead Electric Line\"` (though slightly cut off, the intent is visible).\n*   **Conductors:** There is no explicit text or reference using the word \"conductors\" anywhere on this sheet.","providerMetadata":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}],"finishReason":"stop","usage":{"inputTokens":1439,"outputTokens":768,"totalTokens":5303,"reasoningTokens":3096},"warnings":[],"providerMetadata":{"google":{"promptFeedback":null,"groundingMetadata":null,"urlContextMetadata":null,"safetyRatings":null,"serviceTier":null},"gateway":{"routing":{"originalModelId":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","resolvedProvider":"vertex","resolvedProviderApiModelId":"gemini-3.1-pro-preview","fallbacksAvailable":["google"],"planningReasoning":"System credentials planned for: vertex, google. Total execution order: vertex(system) → google(system)","canonicalSlug":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","finalProvider":"vertex","modelAttemptCount":1,"modelAttempts":[{"modelId":"vertex:gemini-3.1-pro-preview","canonicalSlug":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","success":true,"providerAttemptCount":1,"providerAttempts":[{"provider":"vertex","internalModelId":"vertex:gemini-3.1-pro-preview","providerApiModelId":"gemini-3.1-pro-preview","credentialType":"syst