ire main must be hydrostatically tested at one time. Unless isolation valves are provided between tested sections.\"*\n*   **General Notes:** Note #2 in this section repeats the exact specification from Fire Zone Note #4 regarding the installation and testing of *\"Underground mains feeding private hydrants\"*."}]}
