ere any proposed structures, fences, lighting poles, or other features near the overhead electric lines that might need clearance verification? (5) Compare the overhead electric line locations shown here to what was documented on the existing conditions survey (Sheet 4) - do they appear consistent?"}]}],"headers":{"user-agent":"ai/5.0.152"}}},"response":{"id":"aitxt-Cp2cvpkKhVeE0Qpq6dFJjKz8","timestamp":{},"modelId":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","headers":{"access-control-allow-headers":"Content-Type, Authorization, ai-gateway-auth-method, ai-gateway-protocol-version, ai-model-id, ai-language-model-id, ai-language-model-specification-version, ai-image-model-specification-version, ai-embedding-model-specification-version, ai-language-model-streaming, ai-reporting-tags, ai-reporting-user, http-referer, x-title, anthropic-beta","access-control-allow-methods":"GET, POST, PUT, PATCH, DELETE, OPTIONS","access-control-allow-origin":"*","cache-control":"public, max-age=0, must-revalidate","content-encoding":"br","content-type":"application/json","date":"Fri, 24 Apr 2026 12:00:16 GMT","server":"Vercel","strict-transport-security":"max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload","transfer-encoding":"chunked","vary":"rsc, next-router-state-tree, next-router-prefetch, next-router-segment-prefetch","x-matched-path":"/v1/ai/language-model","x-vercel-cache":"MISS","x-vercel-id":"iad1::iad1::5bhdk-1777031992288-e5df5fea6fba"},"body":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on a careful visual analysis of the provided \"LANDSCAPE PLAN\" (Sheet 28 of 35), here are the findings corresponding to your questions:\n\n**(1) Where are the overhead electric (OHE) utility lines located?**\nThe overhead electric utility lines are located along the **southern boundary** of the site plan (the bottom edge of the drawing). They are clearly denoted by a line type with the text **\"-OHE-\"** running horizontally across the bottom section. \n\n**(2) Are there any proposed trees (shown as symbols with