{"level":30,"time":1777032185896,"pid":122,"hostname":"7e1d7a35-fad","step":"review-runs","item":"2.md","index":4,"runIndex":"run-2","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01KKHuG71eh8DKa4WwneucJ2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Summary\n\nI have completed the site plan review for **Grouping 2: Tree Clearances from Overhead Electric Lines**.\n\n### Key Findings\n\nThe site plan shows a critical compliance issue with tree placement near the overhead electric distribution line along the southern property boundary:\n\n**Critical Deficiencies (FAIL - 3 items):**\n1. **EL-2.1** - Non-utility-compatible trees (Cedar Elm, Live Oak) proposed at 3-6 feet from overhead distribution conductor, well below the required 15-foot minimum\n2. **EL-2.3** - Large trees (90-foot Cedar Elm, 60-foot Live Oak) proposed at 3-6 feet from distribution conductor, well below the required 25-foot minimum for large trees\n3. **EL-2.15** - Trees proposed in prohibited clearance zones without documented Austin Energy written approval\n\n**Cannot Be Verified (NOT-VERIFIABLE - 8 items):**\n- Tree species identification on landscape plan\n- Large tree distinction on landscape plan\n- Utility pole locations not shown\n- Transformer pad clearances\n- Underground equipment locations and clearances\n- Root barrier requirements\n- Dimensioned clearances on plans\n- Proper measurement methodology shown\n\n**Items Passing (Not Included):**\n- Transmission facility items (N/A - no transmission service)\n- Trees and utilities both shown on landscape plan (PASS)\n\nThe most critical issue is that proposed Cedar Elm and Live Oak trees are positioned only 3-6 feet from an overhead distribution conductor that requires 15 feet of clearance for non-utility-compatible species and 25 feet for large trees. These trees must either be relocated or replaced with utility-compatible alternatives."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":11,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9665,"cache_read_input_tokens":68775,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":9665,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"13d31a74-8d60-4982-8b24-9aff9d56548a","uuid":"33ff86a3-8b44-4b16-8dd0-f6d62da42262"}
