ts**\n*   There are no fire hydrants near the transformer pad. \n*   Fire hydrants (labeled with an **\"FH\"** symbol) are located far from the pad: one is located off-site to the west near the `\"Wastewater Service Connection\"`, another is on the far southeast corner near Bldg 6, and another is on the southern boundary line. All are well over 100 feet away from the transformer pad.\n\n**6. Sidewalks, Walkways, or Paved Pedestrian Areas**\n*   The transformer pad is located immediately adjacent to a concrete pedestrian pathway. \n*   A sidewalk runs north-south right next to the pad, labeled **\"Construct 5' Concrete Sidewalk See Dtl 4/326-1\"**. Based on the scale, the western edge of the transformer pad is abutting or within 1 to 2 feet of the eastern edge of this sidewalk.\n\n**7. General Site Grading Direction**\n*   The general site grading slopes **away from the buildings**. \n*   The Finished Floor Elevations (FFE) of the buildings are set higher than the surrounding grades. For example, Bldg 1 has an **\"FFE = 687.50\"**, and the contour lines immediately surrounding it slope downward (showing elevations of 686 and 685). \n*   Runoff is directed away from the structures toward the paved drive aisles, which then convey the water predominantly toward the northeast corner of the site where a **\"Bioretention/Detention Pond\"** is located (with surrounding contours dropping to 681 and 680).","providerOptions":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}]}]},"providerMetadata":{"google":{"promptFeedback":null,"groundingMetadata":null,"urlContextMetadata":null,"safetyRatings":null,"serviceTier":null},"gateway":{"routing":{"originalModelId":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","resolvedProvider":"vertex","resolvedProviderApiModelId":"gemini-3.1-pro-preview","fallbacksAvailable":["google"],"planningReasoning":"System credentials planned for: vertex, google. Total execution order: vertex(system) → google(system)","canonicalSlug":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","finalProvider":"ve