{"level":30,"time":1777033024170,"pid":122,"hostname":"7e1d7a35-fad","step":"review-runs","item":"13.md","index":5,"runIndex":"run-2","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01AxT9Lq5V6zp5jLF21n9v38","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Summary\n\nI have completed the comprehensive review of **Grouping 13 — Transformer Pad Clearances and Location Requirements** for the Valley View Townhomes site plan.\n\n### Key Findings\n\n**3 FAIL items identified:**\n\n1. **EL-13.35** — No transformer easements are depicted on any site plan sheets or exhibits. Easements are required around all five proposed transformer pads with widths to be determined by Austin Energy Design.\n\n2. **EL-13.37** — Transformer pad dimensions are not shown on the electrical plan, and no Austin Energy Design-approved transformer pad detail sheets have been provided. Pad dimensions must match AE Design specifications for the proposed service type and equipment.\n\n3. **EL-13.38** — The transformer pad located in the central area between Buildings 4 and 5 is positioned only 4.1 feet from the drive aisle (vehicle circulation route). Equipment within 4 feet of parking/vehicle routes requires 4-inch diameter galvanized metal bollards per AE Design details. **No bollards are shown on the plans.**\n\n**14 NOT-VERIFIABLE items identified:**\n\nThe not-verifiable items stem primarily from missing documentation: no transformer access door orientation marked, no building elevation drawings showing window/door locations and heights, no utility clearance dimensions marked, transformer type not specified (oil-filled vs. dry), no root barrier details, and concerns about easement compliance due to undepicted easements per the facts.md discrepancies.\n\nAll findings have been submitted in structured format with specific code citations, sheet references, and detailed comments explaining the deficiencies."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":13,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8131,"cache_read_input_tokens":72307,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":8131,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d6a22569-366b-4e39-9203-cc923425b52a","uuid":"b8f51fcc-c030-4286-bb3f-0485a90f2566"}
