eficiencyId":"EL-13.32","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4 footnote 1"],"applicableAreas":["All five transformer pad locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":11},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","label":"Primary Site Plan - Sheet 11 Grading Plan"}],"comment":"Transformer specifications do not identify whether equipment is oil-filled or dry-type. Grading plan shows general site drainage but does not mark drainage flow direction specifically at transformer pad locations. Cannot verify that surface drainage slopes direct liquid flow away from buildings (required for oil-filled transformers per UCM § 1.10.4 footnote 1)."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.34","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4 footnote 4"],"applicableAreas":["All five transformer pad locations relative to recorded easements"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","label":"Primary Site Plan - Sheet 9 Site Plan"}],"comment":"According to facts.md, two critical easements are recorded but NOT depicted on the submitted site plan: (1) Greenbelt Access & Use Easement (Instrument 2010070731) covering 0.31 acres in NE interior, and (2) City of Austin Drainage Easement (Instrument 2011021137) covering 0.130 acres in NE corner. Specific confirmation that all five transformer pads are located outside drainage easements, water easements, sewer easements, and electrical easements under overhead lines cannot be verified without proper easement depiction on plans."}]},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"4a2b5422-a023-4c59-bfea-1db512780e72"}
