{"level":30,"time":1777033061779,"pid":122,"hostname":"7e1d7a35-fad","step":"review-runs","item":"13.md","index":2,"runIndex":"run-1","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01VRCVMZRQ56jVKzGp4TA7Yu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Summary\n\nI have completed the site plan review for the **Transformer Pad Clearances and Location Requirements** grouping (El-MD-Exp-13). \n\n**Key Findings:**\n\nThree deficiencies were identified and documented in the structured output:\n\n1. **EL-13.21 (FAIL)**: Transformer Pads 2 and 3 lack the required 5-foot minimum horizontal clearance from water lines (measured at 0.9 feet and 0 feet respectively).\n\n2. **EL-13.22 (FAIL)**: Transformer Pads 1 and 2 lack the required 5-foot minimum horizontal clearance from wastewater lines (measured at 4.6 feet and 2.5 feet respectively).\n\n3. **EL-13.37 (NOT-VERIFIABLE)**: No Austin Energy Design-approved transformer pad detail sheets are provided in the submission. Pad dimensions cannot be verified against AE Design specifications for the service type.\n\n**Items with Passing Status** (not included in output per instructions):\n- All transformer pads maintain adequate clearance from buildings (6.7+ feet minimum)\n- Fire hydrant clearances exceed 5 feet (40.7 and 82.2 feet measured)\n- Storm drain clearance adequate (16.6 feet)\n- No retaining walls within 5 feet\n- Drainage slopes away from buildings\n- Multiple transformer pads more than 5 feet apart\n\n**Items Not Applicable** (omitted per instructions):\n- Retaining walls, fences, gates, balconies, fire escapes, niches, dumpsters, bike racks, light poles, reduced clearances, etc. - none present adjacent to transformer pads\n\nThe most critical issues are the water and wastewater line conflicts, which require either pad relocation or utility rerouting to achieve compliance with UCM § 2.9.1.B.2 requirements."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":13,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2113,"cache_read_input_tokens":75880,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2113,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bd542ab3-a24e-4d13-af12-e84b414b992a","uuid":"42d55a96-ba49-4990-8a22-ecc6638ab903"}
