 relevant in full detail with perfect accuracy.\n"},{"type":"text","text":"Please examine the tree list table on this sheet and identify:\n1. All proposed (newly planted) trees listed in the table - look for entries marked as \"Plant\", \"New\", \"Propose\", \"Install\", or similar designations\n2. The species name for each proposed tree\n3. Whether any proposed tree species are listed in the ECM Appendix F \"Utility Compatible (UC)\" category\n4. The caliper size (diameter in inches) for each proposed tree\n5. If the table indicates the location or proximity of proposed trees, specifically any trees noted as being near overhead electric facilities or within utility easements"}]}],"headers":{"user-agent":"ai/5.0.152"}}},"response":{"id":"aitxt-mliQGl1Cy54uq1Kf9Gy8NrDn","timestamp":{},"modelId":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","headers":{"access-control-allow-headers":"Content-Type, Authorization, ai-gateway-auth-method, ai-gateway-protocol-version, ai-model-id, ai-language-model-id, ai-language-model-specification-version, ai-image-model-specification-version, ai-embedding-model-specification-version, ai-language-model-streaming, ai-reporting-tags, ai-reporting-user, http-referer, x-title, anthropic-beta","access-control-allow-methods":"GET, POST, PUT, PATCH, DELETE, OPTIONS","access-control-allow-origin":"*","cache-control":"public, max-age=0, must-revalidate","content-encoding":"br","content-type":"application/json","date":"Fri, 24 Apr 2026 12:18:34 GMT","server":"Vercel","strict-transport-security":"max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload","transfer-encoding":"chunked","vary":"rsc, next-router-state-tree, next-router-prefetch, next-router-segment-prefetch","x-matched-path":"/v1/ai/language-model","x-vercel-cache":"MISS","x-vercel-id":"iad1::iad1::7n77n-1777033100510-0a692ff540e7"},"body":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on a meticulous review of the provided \"SURVEYED TREES\" table, here are the findings regarding your specific questions:\n\n1.  **Pr