n all directions cannot be verified. No profile drawings show radial clearance envelopes."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.3","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["Building projections where overhead facilities present"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No building elevation sheets are included in the 39-sheet plan set, preventing verification of overhangs, awnings, balconies, decks, roofs, or patios relative to overhead conductors. Both 7.5-foot sky-to-ground and 15-foot radial clearances for building projections cannot be assessed."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.6","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["Buildings 1 and 2 adjacent to Valley View Road right-of-way"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":4},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Overhead utility lines exist in the right-of-way along Valley View Road (western boundary per Sheet 4), and buildings are proposed within potential clearance distance (Sheet 9). No surveyed conductor elevations or clearance dimensions from outside conductor to buildings are provided, preventing verification of required 7.5-foot and 15-foot clearances."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.7","status":"fail","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["All buildings 1-8"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Building elevation sheets with surveyed conductor elevations and clearance dimension annotations are not included in the submitted site plan. The 39-sheet plan set contains no building elevation drawings. Per UCM § 1.10.3, engineered, sealed elevation drawings showing vertical relationships between overhead conductors and buildings, including all projections, with dimensioned clearances are required."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.8","status":"fail","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["All buildings 1-8 and site structures"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Site plan (Sheet 9) and electrical design plan (Sheet 21) show building locations and site features, but contain no dimension lines or annotations showing distances from outer electric conductors to building edges, projections, or other site features. Required section views and enlarged plan details with dimension lines originating from the outside conductor location are not provided."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.10","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":["Proposed fence post locations throughout property perimeter"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":31},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":35}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Fences are proposed (noted on landscape plan Sheet 31 and landscape calculations Sheet 35), including wooden privacy fences. Existing utility poles are shown on the existing conditions survey (Sheet 4) at multiple property boundaries. Without exact measured distances between proposed fence post locations and existing pole locations, the 10-foot minimum horizontal clearance cannot be verified."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.14","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["Retaining walls throughout site perimeter and around detention pond"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":4},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":38},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":39}],"docu